    {
      "source": "In particular, methods for using StAX (<code>javax.xml.stream</code>) in combination with\nthe TrAX API (<code>javax.xml.transform</code>), and converting StAX readers/writers into SAX\nreaders/handlers and vice-versa.",
      "translation": "特别是使用 StAX（`javax.xml.stream`）与 TrAX API（`javax.xml.transform`）相结合的方法，以及将 StAX 读取器/写入器转换为 SAX 读取器/处理器，反之亦然。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/stream/XMLStreamReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.stream\"><code>XMLStreamReader</code></a> that reads from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/stream/XMLEventReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.stream\"><code>XMLEventReader</code></a>.\nUseful because the StAX <code>XMLInputFactory</code> allows one to create an\nevent reader from a stream reader, but not vice-versa.",
      "translation": "返回一个从 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/stream/XMLEventReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.stream\"><code>XMLEventReader</code></a>` 读取的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/stream/XMLStreamReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.stream\"><code>XMLStreamReader</code></a>`。\n这很有用，因为 StAX `<code>XMLInputFactory</code>` 允许从一个流读取器创建一个事件读取器，但反之则不行。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a SAX <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/xml/sax/ContentHandler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.xml.sax\"><code>ContentHandler</code></a> that writes events to the given StAX <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/stream/XMLEventWriter.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.stream\"><code>XMLEventWriter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个 SAX <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/xml/sax/ContentHandler.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.xml.sax\"><code>ContentHandler</code></a>，将事件写入给定的 StAX <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/stream/XMLEventWriter.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.stream\"><code>XMLEventWriter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
